[2025-04-15 21:50:54,714][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-67 << "                                    Communication protocols are vital for AI Agent development. Anthropic's MCP connects agents to external tools, while Google's A2A enables agent collaboration. This post dives into security vulnerabilities in these protocols that could lead to agent hijacking and data leakage.[\n]"
[2025-04-15 21:50:54,714][DEBUG][org.apache.http.wire] http-outgoing-67 << "                                </span>[\n]"
